    "detailed_description": "<h1>project utgardr chapters</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/9d2eb211b42691c2bd106d1b558c91ea.avif?t=1736450648\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Utgardr will include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHAPTER 1 (2025)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHAPTER 2 (2025)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHAPTER 3 (2025)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Utgardr currently includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CHAPTER 1 (Preview)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chapters will be included in the game and they will not be sold separately.<br>Just before each full chapter's release, the game price will be increased by approximately 10-20%.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Project Utgardr is a first-person parkour platform adventure inspired by Norse and pre-Viking culture.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventuring amidst the mountains of her homeland, Thyra finds a fissure that mysteriously appeared on a cliff face and a hidden passage that crumbles behind her as she passes through it. <br>Thyra, now trapped in uncharted territory and searching for a way home, quickly gets her bearings in the arduous environment using her climbing abilities, discovering timeworn engravings and weathered altars. <br>Coming across an ancient, forgotten tale, Thyra discovers her role in it and follows its fragments to reveal its secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/bf2119e463d3ae60e8e8f8d681c9c702.poster.avif?t=1736450648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/bf2119e463d3ae60e8e8f8d681c9c702.webm?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/bf2119e463d3ae60e8e8f8d681c9c702.mp4?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - The Unexpected Journey of a Young Norse Woman</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore breathtaking landscapes and perilous precipices on a homeward journey after being suddenly stranded in a forgotten corner of ancient Scandinavia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - Intuitive Parkour and Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of Thyra\u2019s parkour abilities to traverse the crumbling road. Sprint through various environments and overcome different obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - Flashes of Norse Culture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ancient runes carved on the hidden crags point towards the right path and abandoned shrines built by an old Norse civilization centuries ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - Unseen Forces Guide You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow shards of a lost myth chiseled into the face of the mountain and discover its secret. Locate strange glowing flowers and pray to the Horgr scattered all over for a safe haven. Something seems keen to help you on this journey\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/4d62d6a8450891cf924d409472381eda.poster.avif?t=1736450648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/4d62d6a8450891cf924d409472381eda.webm?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/4d62d6a8450891cf924d409472381eda.mp4?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Project Utgardr is a first-person parkour platform adventure inspired by Norse and pre-Viking culture.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventuring amidst the mountains of her homeland, Thyra finds a fissure that mysteriously appeared on a cliff face and a hidden passage that crumbles behind her as she passes through it. <br>Thyra, now trapped in uncharted territory and searching for a way home, quickly gets her bearings in the arduous environment using her climbing abilities, discovering timeworn engravings and weathered altars. <br>Coming across an ancient, forgotten tale, Thyra discovers her role in it and follows its fragments to reveal its secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/bf2119e463d3ae60e8e8f8d681c9c702.poster.avif?t=1736450648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/bf2119e463d3ae60e8e8f8d681c9c702.webm?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/bf2119e463d3ae60e8e8f8d681c9c702.mp4?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - The Unexpected Journey of a Young Norse Woman</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore breathtaking landscapes and perilous precipices on a homeward journey after being suddenly stranded in a forgotten corner of ancient Scandinavia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - Intuitive Parkour and Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of Thyra\u2019s parkour abilities to traverse the crumbling road. Sprint through various environments and overcome different obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - Flashes of Norse Culture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ancient runes carved on the hidden crags point towards the right path and abandoned shrines built by an old Norse civilization centuries ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u16b1 - Unseen Forces Guide You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow shards of a lost myth chiseled into the face of the mountain and discover its secret. Locate strange glowing flowers and pray to the Horgr scattered all over for a safe haven. Something seems keen to help you on this journey\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/4d62d6a8450891cf924d409472381eda.poster.avif?t=1736450648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/4d62d6a8450891cf924d409472381eda.webm?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878290/extras/4d62d6a8450891cf924d409472381eda.mp4?t=1736450648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
